{"displayStem":"같은 운동신경을 원위부와 근위부에서 초최대 자극하여 같은 근육에서 기록하였다. 체온과 피부 온도는 적절하고 전극 이동, 비정상 신경 문합과 자극 불충분을 배제하였다. 제시한 면적은 CMAP 음성 부분이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"자료는 독립적으로 작성한 교육용 모의자료이다."}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>CMAP 면적 반복 측정</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"CMAP 면적 반복 측정。자극 부위、면적 (mV·ms)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">면적 (mV·ms)</text><line x1=\"158.5\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"158.5\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"158.5\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">원위</text><line x1=\"433.5\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"433.5\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"433.5\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">근위</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">0</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">7.5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"142\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"142\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"147\" text-anchor=\"end\">15</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.5\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.5\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.5\" text-anchor=\"end\">22.5</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">30</text><circle cx=\"158.5\" cy=\"100.82\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"158.5\" cy=\"104.88000000000001\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"158.5\" cy=\"96.75999999999999\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"433.5\" cy=\"180.28\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"433.5\" cy=\"182.02\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"433.5\" cy=\"179.12\" r=\"3.2\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">반복값</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">자극 부위</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence \"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>항목</th><th>원위 자극</th><th>근위 자극</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>최고 진폭 (mV)</td><td>6.8 / 6.7 / 6.9</td><td>2.4 / 2.3 / 2.5</td></tr><tr><td>음성 지속시간 (ms)</td><td>6.0 / 6.1 / 6.0</td><td>6.4 / 6.5 / 6.4</td></tr><tr><td>분절 운동전도속도</td><td>28m/s</td><td>검사실 정상하한 49m/s</td></tr><tr><td>원위 CMAP</td><td>정상하한 이상</td><td>—</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}